menu "Seismic buffer"

config SEISMIC_BUFFER_SECONDS
    int "Seismic history duration (seconds)"
    range 1 60
    default 4
    help
        Retain at least this much recent acquisition history when the PSRAM
        budget permits. The ring always contains at least 2,048 frames.

config SEISMIC_BUFFER_PSRAM_BUDGET_BYTES
    int "Seismic buffer PSRAM budget (bytes)"
    range 73728 8388608
    default 4194304
    help
        Maximum PSRAM reserved for the realtime seismic ring, including each
        frame's publication sequence and frame number metadata.

endmenu
